<title>USA: Chesapeake Corp names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake Corp names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Corp said on Tuesday it named William Tolley chief financial officer, replacing Andrew Kohut.</p>
<p>Kohut was named group vice president of specialty packaging and merchandising services, the company said.</p>
<p>Tolley was previously vice president of finance and logistics and chief financial officer for Carrier Corp's North American operations in Syracuse, N.Y. Carrier is a division of United Technologies Corp.</p>
</text>
